{"id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","title":"Dual Space","display":"df-dual-space — Dual Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dual-space","aliases":["58-df-dual-space"],"display":"df-dual-space — Dual Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-normed-space]]","[[58-df-bounded-linear]]","[[58-df-operator-norm]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dual-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dual-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dual-space — Dual Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"58-df-normed-space\">58-df-normed-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"261de7e0269cd7e2\" href=\"?note=261de7e0269cd7e2\" title=\"58-df-bounded-linear\">58-df-bounded-linear</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28f93ddcd4761c3f\" href=\"?note=28f93ddcd4761c3f\" title=\"58-df-operator-norm\">58-df-operator-norm</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> with designated data <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\">\\(K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{K_X},\\cdot_{K_X},|\\cdot|_{K_X}\">\\(+_{K_X},\\cdot_{K_X},|\\cdot|_{K_X}\\)</span> (the standard operations and norm on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_X\">\\(K_X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\)</span> (designated-structure normed-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit bounded-linear predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorNorm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorNorm}_S\\)</span> (operator-norm value predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DualNorm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DualNorm}_S\\)</span> (dual-norm value predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dual\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\to X^*\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{f\\in K_X^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(f,X,K_X,K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{K_X},\\cdot_{K_X},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{K_X})\\Bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dual\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\to X^*\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{f\\in K_X^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(f,X,K_X,K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{K_X},\\cdot_{K_X},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{K_X})\\Bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dual\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\\mathrm{DualNorm}_S(r,f,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land f\\in X^*\\land\\mathrm{OperatorNorm}_S(r,f,X,K_X,K_X,+_X,+_{K_X},\\cdot_X,\\cdot_{K_X},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{K_X}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dual\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\\mathrm{DualNorm}_S(r,f,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land f\\in X^*\\land\\mathrm{OperatorNorm}_S(r,f,X,K_X,K_X,+_X,+_{K_X},\\cdot_X,\\cdot_{K_X},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{K_X}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The dual space is the space of all bounded linear functionals.</li>\n<li>The scalar field, both vector-space structures, and the operator-norm value are explicit; the former three-place bounded-linear call did not exist upstream.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> is always a Banach space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-normed-space","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-normed-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-linear","status":"resolved","id":"261de7e0269cd7e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-linear]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-operator-norm","status":"resolved","id":"28f93ddcd4761c3f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-operator-norm]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X","display":false},{"tex":"+_{K_X},\\cdot_{K_X},|\\cdot|_{K_X}","display":false},{"tex":"K_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OperatorNorm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DualNorm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dual\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\to X^*\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{f\\in K_X^X:\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(f,X,K_X,K_X,+_X,\\cdot_X,+_{K_X},\\cdot_{K_X},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{K_X})\\Bigr\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dual\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\\mathrm{DualNorm}_S(r,f,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land f\\in X^*\\land\\mathrm{OperatorNorm}_S(r,f,X,K_X,K_X,+_X,+_{K_X},\\cdot_X,\\cdot_{K_X},\\|\\cdot\\|_X,|\\cdot|_{K_X}).","display":true},{"tex":"X^*","display":false}]